WEBVTT

00:03:59.807 --> 00:04:02.485
had to be held then and there,

00:04:02.509 --> 00:04:04.664
and soon the rules were changed

00:04:04.688 --> 00:04:08.513
so that no game could last
longer than 20 minutes.

00:04:08.537 --> 00:04:10.322
(Laughter)

00:04:10.970 --> 00:04:14.385
Sixteen years later,
Japan entered the picture,

00:04:14.409 --> 00:04:18.798
when a little-known
watchmaker called Hiroji Satoh

00:04:18.822 --> 00:04:23.948
showed up at the world championships
in Bombay in 1952.

00:04:24.647 --> 00:04:28.917
And Satoh was not very big,
he wasn't highly rated,

00:04:28.941 --> 00:04:31.353
he was wearing spectacles,